      <div class="section-label">Our Mission</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">More Than Clothing.</h2>
      <div class="mission-pill">Adoptare — To Adopt</div>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-right">
      <p>Adoptare exists to <strong>empower adopted youth</strong> by providing scholarships funded through clothing initiatives. We believe that every young person deserves to step into their future with confidence, resources, and a community behind them.</p><br/>
      <p>We celebrate adoption as a core part of identity — not something to be hidden, but something to be <strong>worn with pride</strong>. Every piece you purchase directly funds educational opportunities for adoptees and foster kids nationwide.</p><br/>
      <p><strong>Your origins matter. Your story is power.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

