      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;margin-top:1.5rem;">The David Scholarship is named after my little brother David. We grew up being told we'd never amount to anything. This scholarship exists to prove that wrong — for him, and for every adoptee and foster youth who was told the same thing. Where you come from does not determine where you're going.</p>
