          <div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Who Qualifies</div><div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;">Current or former foster youth and adoptees pursuing post-secondary education.</div></div>
