    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(0)">What is Adoptare?<span class="faq-icon" id="fi0">+</span></div><div class="faq-a" id="fa0"><div class="faq-a-inner">Adoptare is a nonprofit streetwear brand founded by Tristan Stuetzel, a 19-year-old former foster youth and adoptee. Our mission is to empower adoptees and foster youth through clothing initiatives and scholarships.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(1)">Where does my money go?<span class="faq-icon" id="fi1">+</span></div><div class="faq-a" id="fa1"><div class="faq-a-inner">100% of clothing sale proceeds go directly toward scholarships for adoptees and foster youth. We keep overhead as low as possible so your purchase makes the biggest impact possible.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(2)">Is Drop 001 available now?<span class="faq-icon" id="fi2">+</span></div><div class="faq-a" id="fa2"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes! Drop 001 is live now. Scroll up to shop the collection directly on this page or visit adoptare.store.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(3)">How do I apply for a scholarship?<span class="faq-icon" id="fi3">+</span></div><div class="faq-a" id="fa3"><div class="faq-a-inner">Scroll up to The David Scholarship section and fill out the application form. Scholarships are need-based and open to current and former foster youth and adoptees pursuing post-secondary education.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(4)">What is your return policy?<span class="faq-icon" id="fi4">+</span></div><div class="faq-a" id="fa4"><div class="faq-a-inner">Contact us within 14 days of delivery at adoptareinfo@gmail.com. Items must be unworn and in original condition. We'll make it right.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(5)">How long does shipping take?<span class="faq-icon" id="fi5">+</span></div><div class="faq-a" id="fa5"><div class="faq-a-inner">Orders ship within 3–5 business days. Standard US delivery takes 5–8 business days. International shipping is available at checkout.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(6)">Is Adoptare a registered nonprofit?<span class="faq-icon" id="fi6">+</span></div><div class="faq-a" id="fa6"><div class="faq-a-inner">Adoptare is in its founding stage and actively pursuing 501(c)(3) nonprofit status. We are committed to full transparency as we grow and formalize the organization.</div></div></div>
